#heading(level: 2, numbering: none)[Notes on the literature]
<notes:double-series>

#notes-on(<sec:hadamard>) All of the results of this section, except for the
lemma of @ss:hadamard-two-dimensional[subsection], are due to Safonov
@bib:Safonov1985, @bib:Safonov1984. The lemma was proved by Tsikh
@bib:Tsikh1985c.

#notes-on(<sec:filter>) The method of calculating the value of the quantization
error using iterated integrals was presented in a paper by Roitman and Swamy
@bib:Roitman1981. Formula @eq:quantization-residues of
@ss:quantization-residues[subsection], which expresses the value of the
quantization error as a sum of local residues, was obtained by Tsikh
@bib:Tsikh1985c.

#notes-on(<sec:integrals>) The theorem of @ss:rational-class[subsection] under
an additional restriction and in another formulation was first established by
Yuzhakov @bib:Yuzhakov1984a. In the situation described in this theorem, the
result of Yuzhakov was generalized by Zhdanov. Our formulation and proof of the
theorem of @ss:rational-class[subsection] differ essentially from those obtained
by Yuzhakov and Zhdanov.
